<title>TURKEY: Turkey sugar tender said awarded to local firms.</title>
<headline>Turkey sugar tender said awarded to local firms.</headline>
<dateline>ANKARA 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkey's 50,000-tonne sugar export tender has been awarded to two local commodities companies, traders said on Thursday.</p>
<p>They declined to identify the firms.</p>
</text>
